                {
                  "id": "rt-contact-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why rent?",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "rt-contact-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "It's simple—get into a reliable truck that you need for however long you need it. With a wide variety of trucks and bodies to choose from, we have the right vehicle for your next job.\n\nWhether you have an unexpected breakdown, need a temporary fleet addition, or have a one-off job, we have you covered.\n\nRent for a day or as long as you need it. Our rentals are well-maintained and backed with peace-of-mind—included 24/7 nation-wide roadside assistance and replacement solutions through our partnership with NationaLease.\n\nIf renting sounds like the solution for you, or if you have questions about our rentals, reach out to us through the Rental Request Form on the right, or call <a href=\"tel:+18882032701\">(888) 203-2701</a>.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "rt-contact-card",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 6,
                "align": "start"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "rt-contact-form",
                  "type": "form",
                  "props": {
                    "formId": "rent-request",
                    "heading": "Rental Request Form",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "anchor": "rent-form"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
